# Exercise the GP menu route backward and forward before completing a race
# handoff. This catches stale input edges and navigation state leaking between
# SELECT MODE, difficulty/OK, course, machine, and machine-settings screens.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120

# Enter GP as Standard, reach course select, then return to SELECT MODE.
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS DOWN 3
WAIT 30
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120

# Re-enter, open and close the cup choice, then back out again.
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS B 3
WAIT 90
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120

# Re-enter, advance to machine select, then unwind to SELECT MODE.
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120

# Re-enter, visit machine settings, unwind every screen, then complete the
# same route once more to prove the menu state is still usable.
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120

PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 1 5400
LOG menu_churn_race_handoff
QUIT
